.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH ag-task-create 1  "create 0.3.0-beta.7"
.SH NAME
ag\-task\-create \- Create a task
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBag task create\fR [\fB\-C\fR|\fB\-\-repo\fR] [\fB\-d\fR|\fB\-\-description\fR] [\fB\-\-as\fR] [\fB\-\-scope\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-source\-task\fR] [\fB\-\-color\fR] [\fB\-\-source\-run\fR] [\fB\-\-max\-attempts\fR] [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fITITLE\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Create a task
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-C\fR, \fB\-\-repo\fR \fI<DIR>\fR
Operate on the repository at this path (default: discovered from the current directory)
.TP
\fB\-d\fR, \fB\-\-description\fR \fI<DESCRIPTION>\fR [default: ]
Description
.TP
\fB\-\-as\fR \fI<IDENTITY>\fR
Act as this identity (`user:alice`, `agent:bot#run_…`, `service:ci`). Also: AG_IDENTITY
.TP
\fB\-\-scope\fR \fI<SCOPE>\fR
Path glob the task is expected to touch (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Machine\-readable JSON output
.TP
\fB\-\-source\-task\fR \fI<SOURCE_TASK>\fR
Original task for an independent follow\-up
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<WHEN>\fR
Colour the output: auto (a terminal, unless NO_COLOR is set), always or never
.TP
\fB\-\-source\-run\fR \fI<SOURCE_RUN>\fR
Failed or abandoned run of \-\-source\-task
.TP
\fB\-\-max\-attempts\fR \fI<MAX_ATTEMPTS>\fR [default: 0]
Total runs permitted (0 leaves the server limit unset)
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Print only what was asked for: no confirmations or hints. Errors and refusals are still shown
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Explain what is happening on standard error: repository, identity, remote, timing
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
<\fITITLE\fR>
Title
.SH VERSION
v0.3.0\-beta.7
